    "For the profit calculation, is the unit price the selling price per finished piece (so revenue = unit price × total pieces produced)?",
    "Is the raw material cost incurred per piece regardless of which equipment is used?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains two distinct clarification requests: one regarding the definition of unit price for revenue calculation and another regarding the basis of raw material cost allocation."
}

{
  "action": "question",
